      "content": "thanks for that. i added those cloudwatch permissions but now i'm getting an error when it tries to actually write the file to the s3 bucket itself. the logs say 'Access Denied' specifically on the s3 putobject call. i thought the resource ARN was right since i added the /* at the end. could there be something else wrong with the s3 part? maybe something relating to the bucket itself and not just the objects?",
